From 6368ced84d558462fe952f579eb71b9af194fb4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stefan <46031448+StefanPetersTM@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 15:56:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] radio: add default-off M2SDR transport controls

Preserve the CP2074B/CP2082 timed-stream behavior and the isolated physical-channel/RF controls required by the CP3114 POC. Diagnostic capture paths remain disabled by default, so standard Soapy behavior is unchanged unless explicitly selected. Refs CP2074, CP2082, CP3114.
